# Source development: copy this file manually to this app root .env; never overwrite an existing file.
# 源码开发：手工复制到本应用根 .env；已有文件由Owner核对，不覆盖。
# Optional profile root: nonblank process > this .env > independent application default.
# 可选profile根：非空进程 > 本文件 > 独立应用默认；空值不是“新空目录”。
# Use an absolute or relative literal path. Relative paths start at the selected env file's directory.
# 可用绝对或相对字面路径；相对路径以所选环境文件所在目录为基准，与启动工作目录无关。
# Examples (choose one): DAA_PROFILE_DIR=./.local/dev or DAA_PROFILE_DIR=/absolute/path/to/daa-profile
# 示例（二选一）：DAA_PROFILE_DIR=./.local/dev 或 DAA_PROFILE_DIR=/absolute/path/to/daa-profile
# No ~, $VAR, ${VAR}, placeholders, parent traversal or existing symlink components. First duplicate wins.
# 不展开 ~、变量或占位符，不接受上级路径和已有符号链接；重复键首项生效。
# On Mac, pre-create and confirm a new empty profile in a controlled parent before first use; retain existing profiles.
# Mac 首次使用新目录前，在受控父目录预建并确认空 profile；已有兼容目录原样沿用。
# First automatic directory creation has an unfixed replacement race; Windows native behavior remains unverified.
# 首次自动创建目录的替换竞态尚未修复；Windows 原生行为待验证。dev/build 不自动隔离数据。
DAA_PROFILE_DIR=

# pnpm tauri dev includes the S7 driver; collection and reporting startup switches default off.
# pnpm tauri dev 已包含 S7 驱动；采集和上报启动开关默认关闭。
# With auto-collection off, connect and collect manually in Workbench; PLC/group/point/storage configuration belongs to UI + SQLite.
# 自动采集关闭时在工作台手动连接和采集；PLC/组/点位/存储配置由 UI + SQLite 管理。
# At startup, the saved auto-collection and auto-reporting switches act independently, subject to their existing admission checks.
# 启动时分别按已保存的自动采集和自动上报开关执行，均受各自既有准入条件约束。
# 普通读取无需.env授权；旧DAA_PLC_READ_ALLOWED和YAML locator忽略，不再迁入示例PLC。
# 高级process DAA_PLC_READ_ALLOWED：缺失允许后续UI动作；false/空/非法/不可解码禁止。
# Advanced process-only absolute DAA_ENV_FILE selects another readable UTF-8 file; invalid selection fails.
# DAA_RUNTIME_MODE=legacy_snapshot in a selected file is ignored; the same process value is rejected.
# Legacy UTC/unknown profiles are preserved and refused; migration needs separate approval.
# Installed-package .env discovery/distribution is outside this source-development contract.
